│ patch_description        │ Crossover of the two programs: keeps the superior hexagonal-lattice initialization from   │
│                          │ the current program (which already reached sum 1.34), but improves it in two ways. First, │
│                          │ all pairwise distance computations are vectorized with numpy broadcasting, dramatically   │
