│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ slsqp_multistart_layouts                                                                  │
│ patch_description        │ Replace heuristic center-nudging with direct nonlinear constrained optimization.          │
│                          │ Candidate center layouts are generated from several hexagonal lattice row patterns (plus  │
│                          │ deterministic jittered variants for diversity), then each candidate is refined by SLSQP   │
│                          │ over all 78 variables (26 x, 26 y, 26 radii) directly maximizing the sum of radii subject │
│                          │ to wall and non-overlap constraints. This is fundamentally different from the prior       │
│                          │ Gauss-Seidel radius growth + center nudging: the optimizer simultaneously moves centers   │
│                          │ and grows radii along the true gradient of the objective, escaping the local traps where  │
│                          │ growing one circle blocks others. A final feasibility repair step slightly shrinks radii  │
│                          │ to guarantee strict validity. Multi-start over diverse layouts provides robustness.       │
