│ patch_description        │ Add a gradient-based polish stage using scipy's SLSQP. After the heuristic                │
│                          │ void-filling/refine loop converges, treat the packing as a constrained optimization:      │
│                          │ maximize sum(r) subject to non-overlap constraints (r_i + r_j <= d_ij) and wall           │
│                          │ constraints (r_i <= min(x,y,1-x,1-y)). Starting from the already-feasible near-optimal    │
│                          │ configuration, SLSQP can make the fine-grained contact adjustments (aligning centers so   │
│                          │ circles touch tangentially in the hexagonal pattern) that the coarse nudge heuristic      │
│                          │ cannot reach. This directly targets the remaining gap toward AlphaEvolve's 2.635.         │
│                          │ Multiple restarts with a fallback ensure feasibility is preserved (we only accept         │
│                          │ improved feasible results).                                                               │
