│ patch_description        │ Two consistent changes, following the recommendation that multi-start breadth beats       │
│                          │ deeper local search:                                                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. **Broader candidate pool with per-variant seeds and radius-level stretch.** Instead of │
│                          │ jittering only from a single RNG stream, each seed layout gets its own deterministic RNG  │
│                          │ seed, generating 2 jittered center variants (σ=0.015) plus 2 radius-stretched variants    │
│                          │ (r_init scaled by 0.9 and 1.1) with mild jitter. This roughly triples the candidate pool  │
│                          │ cheaply and adds a diversification axis (initial radius balance) that the center-only     │
│                          │ jitter could not explore. The radius stretch is threaded through `refine_layout` into     │
│                          │ `grow_radii` via a new `r_init` parameter.                                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 2. **Greedy per-circle hill-climb polish in `refine_layout`.** After the existing         │
│                          │ vector-nudge loop, each circle is tested against 8 small directional displacements (plus  │
│                          │ staying), keeping the first move that strictly increases the total sum. This is a cheap,  │
│                          │ deterministic coordinate-descent step that exploits leftover slack (e.g., circles that    │
│                          │ can slide toward a corner) which the simultaneous nudge pass misses. Two sweeps keep      │
│                          │ runtime bounded.                                                                          │
