│                          │ best-so-far point (`best_z`) which is the raw initial layout or a slightly-improved raw   │
│                          │ result — not from the *repaired* feasible endpoint. The recommendation is to restart      │
│                          │ SLSQP from the repaired (feasible) point after each pass with tighter tolerance, letting  │
