│                          │ feasible near-optimal configuration. This is the most direct route toward closing the gap │
│                          │ to 2.635. I extend the maxiter schedule to include a longer, tighter final pass           │
│                          │ (maxiter=500, ftol=1e-14) and always feed the repaired point back in as the next starting │
│                          │ point, keeping the best result.                                                           │
